text-embedding-3-small", "object": "list", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 821, "total_tokens": 821}}, "input": {"input": ["CORE PROCESS:", "INDEPENDENT COMPLIANCE REVIEW COMMITTEE:A committee to which employees can appeal if high-level executives or HR personnel are involved in a case", "INNOVATIONTECH:The company implementing a disciplinary process and appeal mechanism to ensure fair treatment of employees", "APPEAL MECHANISM:A process allowing employees to contest disciplinary decisions within a specified timeframe", "DISCIPLINARY PROCESS:", "健康与安全委员会:The \"健康与安全委员会\" (Health and Safety Committee) is a pivotal entity within the organization, led by the Chief Operating Officer (COO). This committee plays a crucial role in the development and implementation of safety management policies, ensuring that the organization adheres to the highest standards of safety and health. It is tasked with conducting regular safety checks to identify and mitigate potential risks, thereby fostering a safe working environment for all employees.\n\nIn addition to its proactive safety management responsibilities, the Health and Safety Committee is also charged with overseeing safety improvements across the organization. This involves a continuous evaluation of existing safety measures and the introduction of new strategies to enhance overall safety performance. The committee is vigilant in addressing major safety hazards, ensuring that any significant risks are promptly identified and effectively managed to prevent accidents and incidents.\n\nFurthermore, the committee is responsible for the development and support of health programs that benefit the workforce. These programs are designed to promote the well-being of employees, providing them with the necessary resources and support to maintain their health and safety at work.\n\nOverall, the \"健康与安全委员会\" serves as a cornerstone of the organization's commitment to maintaining a safe and healthy workplace, demonstrating leadership and dedication to the welfare of its employees through comprehensive safety and health initiatives.", "首席运营官:The Chief Operating Officer who leads the Health and Safety Committee", "行政部:The \"行政部\" (Administration Department) plays a crucial role in the organization by managing a variety of essential administrative tasks. This department is actively involved in the Health and Safety Committee, where it contributes to ensuring a safe and healthy work environment for all employees. The Administration Department's responsibilities extend to overseeing the logistical aspects of employee transitions, particularly during the resignation process. This includes handling the return of access cards, badges, and office supplies, ensuring that all company property is accounted for and properly managed. Through these functions, the Administration Department supports the smooth operation of the organization by maintaining order and efficiency in both health and safety initiatives and employee offboarding procedures.", "设施管理部:Department involved in the Health and Safety Committee, responsible for facility management", "IT部:The IT部, or IT Department, plays a crucial role within the organization by being actively involved in the Health and Safety Committee. This involvement underscores their commitment to ensuring a safe and efficient working environment, particularly through the lens of technology and IT-related tasks. One of the key responsibilities of the IT部 is to enhance accessibility for all employees, including those with visual impairments. To this end, the department provides essential tools such as screen reading software and supports keyboard navigation, ensuring that visually impaired employees can effectively interact with digital resources. Through these efforts, the IT部 not only contributes to the overall safety and health standards of the workplace but also champions inclusivity and accessibility, making the work environment more accommodating for everyone.", "安保服务商:Security service provider involved in the Health and Safety Committee", "员工志愿者代表:Employee volunteers who represent the workforce in the Health and Safety Committee", "合规建议激励奖:An incentive award for employees who report risks or provide compliance suggestions, with a maximum reward of 1000 yuan per suggestion", "管理培训和晋升评定:Training and promotion evaluation for outstanding employees who perform well and fulfill their duties", "组织纪律责任专项培训:Annual training for managers on organizational discipline responsibilities", "员工年度健康体检:Annual health check-up for employees, with a participation rate goal of 100%"], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small"}}, "key": "embeddings_ca92c42519dc1b6da873ec225b323fd4511509dd925cab2d680eebec67879d48_v2"}